flowchart TD
    A[User taps Create .rdpkg from raw] --> B[Pick exact raw Renault volume]
    B --> C[Create destination document]
    C --> D{Request UUID already claimed?}
    D -- yes --> X[Ignore stale/replayed start]
    D -- no --> E[Claim request UUID]
    E --> F[Foreground preparation service]
    F --> G[SAF metadata scan]
    G --> H[Copy + normalize to app-private staging]
    H --> I[Modern + Section IR + Runtime IR]
    I --> J[Fast Pack]
    J --> K[Stream final .rdpkg + SHA-256]
    K --> L[Atomic RdpkgImporter.install]
    L --> M[Project volume upsert]
    M --> N[COMPLETE: native reopen]

    F -->|rotation / Activity recreate| O[UI reattaches to persisted run state]
    O --> F

    H -->|Cancel during PREPARING| P[Stop work]
    P --> Q[Delete private staging / incomplete destination]
    Q --> R[CANCELLED: source unchanged]

    N --> S[Terminal status may remain visible]
    R --> S
    S --> T[Follow-up: dismiss × for terminal state only]
